<title>NIGERIA: TABLE-NIGERIA'S BRISCOE H1 PROFITS RISE.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NIGERIA'S BRISCOE H1 PROFITS RISE.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year results for RT Briscoe Nigeria, distributors of vehicles and technical equipment, to end-June 1997. (In million naira)</p>
<p>							  1997    1996</p>
<p>Turnover					     1,000     493</p>
<p>Profit before taxation			    81.0     6.2</p>
<p>Taxation						25.9     2.0</p>
<p>Minority interest				   14.3     0.0</p>
<p> Profit after taxation/minority interest    40.8     4.2</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
